GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
`the days on which the Assembly meets in March 2023` MEANS LIST Date 21 3 2023, Date 5 3 2023, Date 7 3 2023, Date 6 3 2023, Date 19 3 2023, Date 7 3 2023, Date 20 3 2023

