§ `Sections 11 to 16: repeal and expiry`

-- Section 11.
#ASSERT `s 11: the repeal has the effect of reviving the previous Act or part` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 11: the repeal has the effect of reviving the previous Act or part` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11: the repeal has the effect of reviving the previous Act or part` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 11: the repeal has the effect of reviving the previous Act or part` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

